      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Obesity has become an epidemic in American healthcare. Comorbidities such as diabetes and cardiac disease increase the mortality and morbidity for these patients. Obesity-related pain conditions can limit the patient's efforts at increasing activity and limit quality of life. This article will offer information on these conditions and treatment options."},
